[Thinking]
**Creating a CSGO Website**

I need to build a complete HTML document for a single-page CSGO website. I should probably include CSS and JS inline to keep everything in one place. It’s important to craft an attractive gaming site, and I'll need to mention that if the user wants images or other assets, they can replace the placeholders I'll include. Most likely the user prefers to see the full code, so that's what I'll focus on.
[/Thinking]

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>CSGO Nexus | Competitive Counter-Strike Hub</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A modern CSGO-inspired website for teams, stats, news, and tournaments." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0b0f14;
      --bg2:#101722;
      --card:#131b27cc;
      --text:#e8eef7;
      --muted:#93a4b8;
      --accent:#ffb000;
      --accent2:#2dd4bf;
      --danger:#ff5d5d;
      --line:#223044;
      --shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      --radius:18px;
    }

    *{ box-sizing:border-box; }
    html{ scroll-behavior:smooth; }
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family: Inter, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(255,176,0,.12), transparent 30%),
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(45,212,191,.10), transparent 25%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #090d12 0%, #0b0f14 100%);
      color:var(--text);
      overflow-x:hidden;
    }

    a{ color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
    img{ max-width:100%; display:block; }

    .container{
      width:min(1200px, 92%);
      margin:0 auto;
    }

    /* Header */
    header{
      position:sticky;
      top:0;
      z-index:1000;
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      background: rgba(11,15,20,.72);
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    }

    .nav{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:20px;
      padding:16px 0;
    }

    .logo{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      font-weight:800;
      letter-spacing:.08em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    .logo-badge{
      width:42px;
      height:42px;
      border-radius:12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #ff7b00);
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      color:#111;
      font-weight:900;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(255,176,0,.25);
    }

    .nav-links{
      display:flex;
      gap:24px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-weight:600;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover{ color:var(--text); }

    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      padding:12px 18px;
      border-radius:14px;
      border:1px solid transparent;
      font-weight:700;
      transition:.25s ease;
      cursor:pointer;
      user-select:none;
    }

    .btn-primary{
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #ff8f00);
      color:#111;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(255,176,0,.22);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover{ transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .btn-secondary{
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.03);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover{
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero{
      position:relative;
      padding:90px 0 70px;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .hero::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,176,0,.08), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(45,212,191,.06), transparent 35%);
      pointer-events:none;
    }

    .hero-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr;
      gap:34px;
      align-items:center;
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
    }

    .tag{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:10px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.05);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      color:var(--muted);
      border-radius:999px;
      padding:10px 14px;
      font-size:.9rem;
      margin-bottom:18px;
    }

    .tag span{
      width:10px;
      height:10px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background: var(--danger);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(255,93,93,.12);
    }

    h1{
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5.2rem);
      line-height: .95;
      margin:0 0 16px;
      letter-spacing:-.04em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
    }

    h1 .accent{ color: var(--accent); }
    h1 .cyan{ color: var(--accent2); }

    .hero p{
      color:var(--muted);
      max-width: 62ch;
      font-size:1.05rem;
      line-height:1.7;
      margin:0 0 24px;
    }

    .hero-actions{
      display:flex;
      gap:14px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      margin-bottom:26px;
    }

    .stats{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap:14px;
      margin-top:22px;
    }

    .stat{
      background: rgba(19,27,39,.72);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding:18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .stat strong{
      display:block;
      font-size:1.6rem;
      margin-bottom:6px;
    }
    .stat span{ color:var(--muted); font-size:.95rem; }

    .hero-card{
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(19,27,39,.92), rgba(15,21,32,.88));
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding:22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .hero-card::after{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:auto -40px -40px auto;
      width:180px;
      height:180px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,176,0,.22), transparent 65%);
      pointer-events:none;
    }

    .card-top{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      margin-bottom:16px;
      gap:12px;
    }

    .live{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:10px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.9rem;
      font-weight:600;
    }
    .pulse{
      width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%;
      background:var(--danger);
      box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(255,93,93,.12);
      animation:pulse 1.4s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse{
      0%{ transform:scale(.9); box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,93,93,.2);}
      70%{ transform:scale(1); box-shadow:0 0 0 10px rgba(255,93,93,0);}
      100%{ transform:scale(.9); box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,93,93,0);}
    }

    .map-preview{
      border-radius:22px;
      min-height:280px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.25), rgba(0,0,0,.55)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511512578047-dfb367046420?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80") center/cover;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .map-overlay{
      position:absolute;
      inset:auto 0 0 0;
      padding:18px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(0,0,0,.78));
    }

    .map-overlay h3{
      margin:0 0 6px;
      font-size:1.4rem;
    }

    .map-overlay p{
      margin:0;
      color:#cdd7e3;
      font-size:.95rem;
    }

    /* Sections */
    section{
      padding:70px 0;
    }

    .section-title{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:end;
      gap:18px;
      margin-bottom:24px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .section-title h2{
      margin:0;
      font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
      text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:-.03em;
    }

    .section-title p{
      margin:0;
      color:var(--muted);
      max-width:60ch;
      line-height:1.6;
    }

    .grid{
      display:grid;
      gap:18px;
    }

    .cards-3{ grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    .cards-2{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }

    .card{
      background: rgba(19,27,39,.82);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding:22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .card h3{ margin:0 0 10px; font-size:1.15rem; }
    .card p{ margin:0; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.65; }

    .icon{
      width:48px;
      height:48px;
      border-radius:14px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      margin-bottom:14px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,176,0,.18), rgba(45,212,191,.14));
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      font-size:1.2rem;
    }

    /* Tournament section */
    .tournament{
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.02), rgba(255,255,255,0));
    }

    .tourney-banner{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap:18px;
      align-items:center;
    }

    .match{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      padding:16px;
      border-radius:18px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
      margin-top:12px;
    }

    .team{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .badge{
      padding:6px 10px;
      border-radius:999px;
      font-size:.8rem;
      background: rgba(45,212,191,.12);
      color: var(--accent2);
      border:1px solid rgba(45,212,191,.18);
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer{
      border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      padding:30px 0;
      color:var(--muted);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,.15);
    }

    .footer-row{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:14px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      align-items:center;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 900px){
      .hero-grid, .tourney-banner, .cards-3, .cards-2{
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .stats{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }
      .nav{
        flex-direction:column;
        align-items:flex-start;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px){
      .hero{
        padding:60px 0 50px;
      }
      .nav-links{
        gap:14px;
      }
      .hero-actions .btn{
        width:100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <a href="#home" class="logo">
        <div class="logo-badge">CS</div>
        <div>CSGO Nexus</div>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#teams">Teams</a>
        <a href="#tournaments">Tournaments</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>

      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Join Now</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="home">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="tag"><span></span> Live Competitive Hub for Counter-Strike Fans</div>
          <h1>Dominate the <span class="accent">server</span>.<br><span class="cyan">Own</span> the round.</h1>
          <p>
            Welcome to CSGO Nexus — a modern gaming website built for players, teams, and communities.
            Track matches, explore top squads, and stay updated on the latest tournaments, strategies, and esports news.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#features" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Features</a>
            <a href="#tournaments" class="btn btn-secondary">View Tournaments</a>
          </div>

          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>128</strong>
              <span>Active Teams</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>42K</strong>
              <span>Weekly Players</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>15</strong>
              <span>Upcoming Events</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="card-top">
            <div class="live"><span class="pulse"></span> Match Live Now</div>
            <div class="badge">Premier League</div>
          </div>

          <div class="map-preview">
            <div class="map-overlay">
              <h3>Dust II Showdown</h3>
              <p>Team Vortex vs. Redline | Best of 3 | Score: 12 - 10</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <div>
            <h2>Website Features</h2>
            <p>Everything a CSGO community needs to follow teams, events, and gameplay highlights.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid cards-3">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🎯</div>
            <h3>Match Tracking</h3>
            <p>Show scores, live rounds, player stats, and map history in a clean esports-style layout.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🧠</div>
            <h3>Strategy Guides</h3>
            <p>Share tips for aim, utility usage, bombsite executes, and competitive team coordination.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🏆</div>
            <h3>Tournament Pages</h3>
            <p>Display brackets, standings, event schedules, prize pools, and registered squads.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="teams">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <div>
            <h2>Top Teams</h2>
            <p>Spotlight on some of the best squads in the scene.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid cards-3">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">1</div>
            <h3>Team Vortex</h3>
            <p>Aggressive entry style with a strong A-site execute and sharp pistol rounds.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">2</div>
            <h3>Redline Esports</h3>
            <p>Known for disciplined defense, high clutch rate, and elite utility timing.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">3</div>
            <h3>Phantom Five</h3>
            <p>Fast rotations, smart mid control, and some of the best aim mechanics online.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="tournaments" class="tournament">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <div>
            <h2>Upcoming Tournaments</h2>
            <p>Keep track of the biggest events and the next matches on the calendar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tourney-banner">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>CSGO Nexus Cup 2026</h3>
            <p>Open registration for teams of all skill levels. Compete in a knockout format with cash prizes and featured stream coverage.</p>

            <div class="match">
              <div class="team">🔥 Group Stage Starts</div>
              <div class="badge">June 10</div>
            </div>

            <div class="match">
              <div class="team">💰 Prize Pool</div>
              <div class="badge">$25,000</div>
            </div>

            <div class="match">
              <div class="team">🎮 Format</div>
              <div class="badge">BO3 / BO5 Finals</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Featured Match</h3>
            <p>Don’t miss the next competitive showdown.</p>

            <div class="match">
              <div>
                <div class="team">Team Vortex</div>
                <div style="color:var(--muted); font-size:.9rem; margin-top:4px;">Mirage / Inferno / Nuke</div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge">21:00 UTC</div>
            </div>

            <div class="match">
              <div>
                <div class="team">Redline Esports</div>
                <div style="color:var(--muted); font-size:.9rem; margin-top:4px;">Best of 3</div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge">LIVE</div>
            </div>

            <div class="match">
              <div class="team">Stream Channel</div>
              <div class="badge">Twitch</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <div>
            <h2>Contact & Join</h2>
            <p>Want to build a team page, news board, or tournament site? Start here.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid cards-2">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Join the Community</h3>
            <p>Subscribe for updates, match schedules, and tournament announcements.</p>
            <form style="margin-top:18px; display:grid; gap:12px;">
              <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" style="padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); background:rgba(255,255,255,.04); color:var(--text); outline:none;">
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Subscribe</button>
            </form>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Follow Us</h3>
            <p>Stay connected on social media for clips, announcements, and live event coverage.</p>
            <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:18px;">
              <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Discord</a>
              <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">YouTube</a>
              <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Twitch</a>
              <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">X / Twitter</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-row">
      <div>© 2026 CSGO Nexus. All rights reserved.</div>

